# Variáveis
@auth = http://localhost:8081
@gateway = http://localhost:8082
@events = http://localhost:8083
@history = http://localhost:8084
@payment = http://localhost:8085
@ticket = http://localhost:8086
@discovery = http://localhost:8080

### Auth - Registrar usuário
POST {{auth}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "João Silva",
  "email": "joao@example.com",
  "password": "minhasenha123"
}

### Auth - Login com senha (retorna accessToken)
POST {{auth}}/auth/login/password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "joao@example.com",
  "password": "minhasenha123"
}

### Auth - Request magic link (aceita mesmo que usuário não exista)
POST {{auth}}/auth/login/magic
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "joao@example.com"
}

### Auth - Verificar magic link (usa token recebido por e-mail)
POST {{auth}}/auth/login/magic/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "TOKEN_RECEBIDO"
}

### Users - Listar (paginação Spring)
GET {{auth}}/users?page=0&size=10

### Health checks dos serviços
GET {{events}}/s/api/event/_health
GET {{ticket}}/s/api/ticket/_health
GET {{payment}}/api/payment/_health
GET {{history}}/api/history/_health
GET {{gateway}}/actuator/health
GET {{discovery}}/actuator/health

### Ticket Service - Criar reserva
# Parâmetros obrigatórios: userId, eventId, ttlSeconds (em segundos)
POST {{ticket}}/api/reservations?userId=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000&eventId=11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111&ttlSeconds=600
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

[
  "A1",
  "A2"
]

### Ticket Service - Cancelar reserva
DELETE {{ticket}}/api/reservations/{reservationId}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Ticket Service - Commit reserva (gera tickets)
POST {{ticket}}/api/reservations/{reservationId}/commit
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Ticket Service - Regenerar QR do ticket
POST {{ticket}}/api/tickets/{ticketId}/qr/regenerate
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Ticket Service - Transferir ticket
POST {{ticket}}/api/tickets/{ticketId}/transfer?fromUser=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000&toUser=22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

# Observações
- Substitua `{{accessToken}}` pelo token retornado no login.
- As portas usadas seguem o `docker-compose.yml` do repositório (host:container):
  - `auth` → host:8081 (container:8080)
  - `gateway` → host:8082
  - `events` → host:8083
  - `history` → host:8084
  - `payment` → host:8085
  - `ticket` → host:8086
  - `service-discovery` → host:8080